    {
      "id": "D02",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "丰川祥子",
      "text": "continue 只是相同动作，却不是相同原因。\n执行工具、压缩上下文、扩大输出或续写，都要先准备好下一轮。\n如果不知道为什么继续，就无法正确准备。",
      "direction": "horizontal",
      "x": 220,
      "y": 1354,
      "width": 956,
      "height": 152,
      "padding": 22,
      "fontFamily": "PingFang SC",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "minFontSize": 17,
      "fontWeight": 600,
      "lineHeight": 1.22,
      "align": "left",
      "appearance": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "id": "B01",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "准确性边界：这七个名称来自参考实现的分类，不代表稳定的公共 API。",
      "direction": "horizontal",
      "x": 64,
      "y": 1530,
      "width": 1112,
      "height": 58,
      "padding": 12,
      "fontFamily": "PingFang SC",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "minFontSize": 15,
      "fontWeight": 600,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "align": "center",
      "appearance": "card"
    },
    {
      "id": "K01",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "生产级循环判断的不是“有没有 tool_use”，\n而是“当前查询是否已进入不可再继续的终态”。",
      "direction": "horizontal",
      "x": 64,
      "y": 1604,
      "width": 1112,
